OVERVIEW: Batch convert multiple files

Convert multiple DICOM files to HL7/FHIR or vice versa in batch mode.

USAGE: dicom-gateway batch <conversion-type> <input-pattern> --output <output> [--type <type>] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <conversion-type>       Conversion type: dicom-to-hl7, dicom-to-fhir
  <input-pattern>         Input file pattern (e.g., studies/*.dcm)

OPTIONS:
  -o, --output <output>   Output directory
  --type <type>           Message/resource type (default: ADT)
  -v, --verbose           Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

